e new backend engineer starts on 2 November. The second\nposition stays open until the end of the year.\n\n", "tokens": [11874, 19713, 10093, 527, 1825, 13, 31048, 11426, 8813, 279, 1620, 7274, 4883, 11, 323, 198, 606, 3085, 574, 11928, 25, 279, 502, 19713, 24490, 8638, 389, 220, 17, 6841, 13, 578, 2132, 198, 3571, 27656, 1825, 3156, 279, 842, 315, 279, 1060, 382], "positions": [172, 173, 174, 175, 176, 177, 178, 179, 180, 181, 182, 183, 184, 185, 186, 187, 188, 189, 190, 191, 192, 193, 194, 195, 196, 197, 198, 199, 200, 201, 202, 203, 204, 205, 206, 207, 208, 209, 210, 211, 212, 213, 214, 215], "seq_ids": [2], "token_class": "CCCCCCCCCCCCCCCWCCCCCCCCCCCWCCCCCWCCCCCCCCCC"}, {"id": "n21", "node_type": "heading", "parent": "n16", "children": ["n22", "n23", "n24"], "depth": 3, "title": "Database migration", "path": "Platform Team Meeting — 9 October 2026 > Discussion > Database migration", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "unit": "u6", "text": "### Database migration\n\n", "tokens": [14711, 10199, 12172, 271], "positions": [168, 169, 170, 171], "seq_ids": [3], "token_class": "MCCW"}, {"id": "n22", "node_type": "paragraph", "parent": "n21", "children": [], "depth": 4, "title": "", "path": "Platform Team Meeting — 9 October 2026 > Discussion > Database migration", "attrs": {}, "unit": "u6", "text": "Wen proposed moving the orders database from PostgreSQL 13 to PostgreSQL 16. The\nmigration will use logical replication, so the old and new clusters run side by side for\ntwo weeks. The cut-over window is planned for **Saturday 14 November, 02:00 to 04:00\nUTC**, when traffic is lowest.\n\n", "tokens": [54, 268, 11223, 7366, 279, 10373, 4729, 505, 74701, 220, 1032, 311, 74701, 220, 845, 13, 578, 198, 81327, 690, 1005, 20406, 48891, 11, 779, 279, 2362, 323, 502, 28066, 1629, 3185, 555, 3185, 369, 198, 20375, 5672, 13, 578, 4018, 29352, 3321, 374, 13205, 369, 3146, 34774, 220, 975, 6841, 11, 220, 2437, 25, 410, 311, 220, 2371, 25, 410, 198, 21872, 98319, 994, 9629, 374, 15821, 382], "po